Test data
---------

The schemas and documents in the tests are written for the tests.

The test-only nested module testsuite/ (github.com/cB-Sigma/jsonschema/testsuite,
not part of this module's build) vendors files of the JSON Schema Test
Suite (https://github.com/json-schema-org/JSON-Schema-Test-Suite, commit
7de0e6a06031ede80028583dd45d0cd41105ae5b of 2026-10-09) under
testsuite/testdata/JSON-Schema-Test-Suite/: the tests of draft4, draft6,
draft7, draft2019-09 and draft2020-12, the remotes, and its LICENSE.
